## 2. Semantics đề xuất (default + trade-off)

### 2.1 Revise (Q1 — quan trọng nhất)

**Default (a) — Create new revision**: SpecHub-aligned, audit/compliance complete.

```
Trước:  rev_A (Approved, Id=1)
Revise (reason="Substrate brand change")
Sau:    rev_A (Status=Superseded, EffectiveTo=now)
        rev_B (Status=Draft, ParentRevisionId=1, ChangeSummary=reason,
               4 sibling specs deep-cloned từ rev_A, Id=2)
```

**Algorithm**:
1. Load source rev với 4 sibling specs (Material/Print/Diecut/Finishing) via Include
2. Compute `nextRev()`: A→B→C→…→Z→AA→AB→… (port SpecHub `nextRev` JS sang C# helper)
3. Wrap trong DB transaction:
   - INSERT new ProductRevision với SpecCode kế thừa, RevisionCode=bumped, Status=Draft, ParentRevisionId=src.Id, ChangeSummary=reason, Title=src.Title (operator edit sau qua Edit)
   - Deep clone 4 sibling specs (Material/Print/Diecut/Finishing) với ProductRevisionId=new.Id
   - UPDATE old rev: Status=Superseded, EffectiveTo=UtcNow
4. Audit emit `SPEC_REVISE` với detail JSON `{source_id, source_rev, new_id, new_rev, reason}`

**Trade-off (b) Rewrite in-place**: mất lịch sử + không có compliance audit trail. REJECT.

### 2.2 Supersede (Q2)

**Default**: Auto-supersede từ Revise flow + cho phép manual "Mark Superseded" trên Approved/Released rev (admin override, KHÔNG yêu cầu tạo rev mới).

**Manual Mark Superseded**:
- Active khi `Status ∈ {Approved, Released}` (Draft/InReview không cần superseded; Superseded đã rồi)
- Confirm dialog 2-step (admin override action)
- Set `Status=Superseded`, `EffectiveTo=UtcNow`
- KHÔNG tạo rev mới
- Audit emit `SPEC_SUPERSEDE` với detail `{from_status, manual=true}`

**Trade-off**: Cho phép manual Superseded không có rev kế thừa → spec lifecycle "dangling" (không có active rev). Lý do vẫn cho phép: production code có thể bị obsolete hoàn toàn (vd product retired).

### 2.3 Copy (Q3)

**Default**: Tạo ProductRevision độc lập với SpecCode rỗng (operator nhập), RevCode='A', ParentRevisionId=null (KHÔNG lineage vì là copy chứ không phải Revise), Status=Draft. Deep clone 4 sibling specs.

**Form**: mirror PR #27 `WorkCenterEditModal` Copy mode:
- SpecCode (empty, operator nhập, validate unique giống Create)
- Title (pre-fill `<old title> (copy)`)
- ProductId dropdown (operator có thể chuyển product)
- ProcessCode pre-fill từ source (operator có thể đổi)

Audit emit `SPEC_COPY` với detail `{source_id, source_code, source_rev, new_id, new_code}`.

### 2.4 Edit (Q4 — KHÔNG có trong message ban đầu, em đề xuất scope hẹp)

**Default scope hẹp**: SpecEditModal cho phép edit Identity + SpecPrint.ColorSpecJson params (Width/Height/Process). KHÔNG full 4-sub-tab editor (defer Phase 9).

**Gate**: chỉ enable khi `Status=Draft`. Approved/Released/Superseded rev immutable per SpecHub principle 2 ("Released revs immutable").

**Form fields**:
- Title (editable)
- ProcessCode (dropdown từ ProcessCatalog)
- ColorSpecJson params table (Add/Remove rows mirror CreateSpecModal)

Audit emit `SPEC_UPDATE` với detail `{rev_id, fields_changed[]}` (deep diff sẽ defer; Phase 9).

### 2.5 Trash + blockers (Q5)

**Default blocker**: chặn trash nếu có WO active reference.

```csharp
async Task<TrashResult> TrashAsync(long revisionId, string user) {
    // 1. Load rev
    var rev = await _db.ProductRevisions.FindAsync(revisionId);
    if (rev is null) return TrashResult.NotFound;
    if (rev.IsTrashed) return TrashResult.AlreadyTrashed;

    // 2. Blocker check: active WO reference?
    var activeWoCount = await _db.WorkOrders
        .Where(w => w.ProductRevisionId == revisionId
                  && w.Status != WoStatus.Closed
                  && w.Status != WoStatus.Cancelled)
        .CountAsync();
    if (activeWoCount > 0)
        return TrashResult.BlockedByActiveWorkOrders(activeWoCount);

    // 3. Soft-delete in tx + audit
    using var tx = await _db.Database.BeginTransactionAsync();
    rev.IsTrashed = true;
    rev.TrashedAt = DateTime.UtcNow;
    rev.TrashedBy = user;
    await _db.SaveChangesAsync();
    await _audit.EmitAsync(AuditAction.SpecTrash, user, ...);
    await tx.CommitAsync();
    return TrashResult.Ok;
}
```

**Q5 sub**: Có chặn trash Approved/Released rev nếu KHÔNG có WO active? Default: cho phép (operator discretion + audit). Closed/Cancelled WO không block — historical reference OK.

### 2.6 Restore (Q6)

**Default**: simple flip `IsTrashed=false`, clear TrashedAt/TrashedBy.

**Gate**: chỉ available trong Trash view. KHÔNG có blocker (restore safe — không tạo orphan).

Audit `SPEC_RESTORE`.

### 2.7 Purge HostedService (Q7)

**Default**: `BackgroundService` chạy cycle 24h (configurable). Hard-delete `IsTrashed=true AND TrashedAt < UtcNow - retention`. Retention default 30 days, env `OPS_SPEC_TRASH_RETENTION_DAYS=30`.

**Architecture**:
```csharp
public class SpecTrashPurgeService : BackgroundService {
    private readonly IServiceScopeFactory _scopes;
    private readonly TimeSpan _cycle = TimeSpan.FromHours(24);
    private readonly int _retentionDays;  // from env

    protected override async Task ExecuteAsync(CancellationToken ct) {
        // First-run delay 30s để server boot xong + DbSeeder finish.
        await Task.Delay(TimeSpan.FromSeconds(30), ct);
        while (!ct.IsCancellationRequested) {
            await RunPurgeCycleAsync(ct);
            await Task.Delay(_cycle, ct);
        }
    }

    async Task RunPurgeCycleAsync(CancellationToken ct) {
        using var scope = _scopes.CreateScope();
        var db = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<IMesDbContext>();
        var audit = scope.ServiceProvider.GetRequiredService<IAuditWriter>();
        var cutoff = DateTime.UtcNow.AddDays(-_retentionDays);

        var eligible = await db.ProductRevisions
            .Where(r => r.IsTrashed && r.TrashedAt < cutoff)
            .ToListAsync(ct);
        if (eligible.Count == 0) {
            _logger.LogInformation("Spec trash purge cycle: 0 eligible (cutoff={cutoff:o})", cutoff);
            return;
        }
        var ids = eligible.Select(r => r.Id).ToList();
        db.ProductRevisions.RemoveRange(eligible);  // cascade 4 sibling + drawings + QC via FK ON DELETE CASCADE
        await db.SaveChangesAsync(ct);
        await audit.EmitAsync(AuditAction.SpecPurge, "system",
            detail: JsonSerializer.Serialize(new { purged_count = eligible.Count, ids, cutoff }));
        _logger.LogInformation("Spec trash purge cycle: purged {count} revs (ids={ids})", eligible.Count, ids);
    }
}
```

**Idempotent guarantees**:
- Run cycle nhiều lần không xóa lại — chỉ load `WHERE IsTrashed AND TrashedAt < cutoff`; sau khi remove rows không còn match
- Server restart giữa cycle → tiếp tục, không double-delete
- Cycle chạy KHÔNG đụng row chưa quá hạn (test isolated trên /tmp với cutoff date logic verified)

**Boot safety**: 30s first-run delay tránh chạy trong DbSeeder cycle.

**Test plan** (verify isolated):
```bash
# 1. Backup live, copy sang /tmp/purge-test.db
# 2. Tạo fake trashed rev với TrashedAt = NOW - 31 days (eligible)
# 3. Tạo fake trashed rev với TrashedAt = NOW - 29 days (not eligible)
# 4. Set OPS_SPEC_TRASH_RETENTION_DAYS=30
# 5. Boot server trên /tmp DB, đợi 35s, kiểm: eligible rev gone, 29-day rev intact
# 6. Audit log có SPEC_PURGE với count=1 + id
# 7. Restart server, đợi 35s, kiểm: thêm cycle SPEC_PURGE count=0 (idempotent)
```

