### 2.10 nextRev helper

Port SpecHub `nextRev()` (HTML:11343):
```csharp
public static string NextRev(string current) {
    var r = (current ?? "A").Trim().ToUpperInvariant();
    if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(r)) return "B";
    if (r == "Z") return "AA";
    var chars = r.ToCharArray();
    int i = chars.Length - 1;
    while (i >= 0) {
        if (chars[i] == 'Z') { chars[i] = 'A'; i--; }
        else { chars[i] = (char)(chars[i] + 1); break; }
    }
    return i < 0 ? "A" + new string(chars) : new string(chars);
}
```

Tests: A→B, B→C, Y→Z, Z→AA, AZ→BA, ZZ→AAA.

