## 3. Audit codes mới đề xuất (~5)

ADD vào `src/CCL.MES.Domain/Audit/AuditAction.cs`:

```csharp
public const string SpecRevise     = "SPEC_REVISE";      // tạo rev mới (auto-supersede old)
public const string SpecCopy       = "SPEC_COPY";        // copy độc lập
public const string SpecUpdate     = "SPEC_UPDATE";      // edit in-place Draft rev
public const string SpecSupersede  = "SPEC_SUPERSEDE";   // manual mark superseded (KHÔNG revise)
public const string SpecTrash      = "SPEC_TRASH";       // soft-delete
public const string SpecRestore    = "SPEC_RESTORE";     // un-trash
public const string SpecPurge      = "SPEC_PURGE";       // HostedService cycle hard-delete
```

**Detail JSON shape** (sanitize, ≤ 4 KB):
- `SPEC_REVISE`: `{source_id, source_rev, new_id, new_rev, reason}`
- `SPEC_COPY`: `{source_id, source_code, source_rev, new_id, new_code}`
- `SPEC_UPDATE`: `{rev_id, rev_code, fields_changed: []}`
- `SPEC_SUPERSEDE`: `{rev_id, rev_code, from_status, manual: true}`
- `SPEC_TRASH`: `{rev_id, rev_code, status}`
- `SPEC_RESTORE`: `{rev_id, rev_code}`
- `SPEC_PURGE`: `{purged_count, ids: [], cutoff_utc}`

