## 7. Q1-Q10 chờ anh chốt (default em đề xuất)

| Q | Default em đề xuất | Trade-off |
|---|---|---|
| **Q1 Revise semantics** | (a) New revision: bump RevCode, lineage ParentRevisionId, 4 sibling deep-clone, old auto-Superseded, reason mandatory | (b) Rewrite in-place: mất history → REJECT |
| **Q2 Supersede auto vs manual** | Cả 2: auto trong Revise flow + manual "Mark Superseded" cho Approved/Released | — |
| **Q3 Copy form** | Mirror WC Copy: SpecCode empty (operator nhập), Title pre-fill `(copy)`, ProductId dropdown, ProcessCode pre-fill | — |
| **Q4 Edit scope** | Hẹp: Identity + ColorSpecJson params, gate Draft only. Full 4-sub-tab editor defer Phase 9 | — |
| **Q5 Trash blocker** | Chặn nếu có WO Status ∉ {Closed, Cancelled}. Closed/Cancelled WO không block (historical OK) | — |
| **Q6 Restore gate** | Không blocker — restore safe | — |
| **Q7 Purge cycle + retention** | BackgroundService 24h cycle, retention 30 days env-overridable (`OPS_SPEC_TRASH_RETENTION_DAYS`), first-run 30s delay | — |
| **Q8 Wire context menu items** | Edit (Draft only) + Copy (always) + Revise (Approved/Released) + Mark Superseded (Approved/Released) + Trash (always) | Items không match gate hiện disabled + tooltip explain |
| **Q9 Trash sub-view** | Filter chip `[All / Active / Trash]` trên toolbar, default Active. Trash rows: line-through grey + show TrashedAt/By columns + Restore button | — |
| **Q10 Audit codes mới** | 7 codes: SPEC_REVISE / SPEC_COPY / SPEC_UPDATE / SPEC_SUPERSEDE / SPEC_TRASH / SPEC_RESTORE / SPEC_PURGE | — |

**Bonus question Q11 — Mark Superseded confirm UX**:
- Default: 1-step confirm dialog "Mark spec X Rev Y as Superseded? This is reversible only by Admin via direct DB intervention." (admin manual ≠ Revise, không tạo rev mới — operator phải hiểu là one-way trên thực tế)
- Alternative: 2-step confirm (type SpecCode để xác nhận). Em đề xuất 2-step vì semi-irreversible.

**Bonus question Q12 — UI trash auto-purge countdown**:
- Default: hiển thị `TrashedAt + 30 days = <purge date>` trong Trash view row tooltip. Nice-to-have, không blocking.

